'''Pokémon Elements''' is a collection of DVDs published by [[VIZ Media]]. It is the successor to the {{OBP|Pokémon All-Stars|Region 1}} series, with the first volumes released just three months after that series ended. Each DVD includes three episodes of {{aniseries|PTS}}, with a theme of one specific Pokémon [[type]].

All ten volumes were released two at a time, with new volumes being released from July 28, 2009 to March 23, 2010. Two collections were released on August 31, 2010 and January 25, 2011, containing five volumes each.

